  "operation": "Preserve original graph references, flags, scopes, hit/flight delays and client start-grid presentation. Server next-hop selection is unavailable. The confirmed offline decision uses the previous actual hit cell plus original skill Range, stops without legal candidates, obeys Repeat/Back/PreferUnvisited, then chooses nearest squared grid distance with unit ID and original body-cell order ties. Per-cast shared branch histories and independent root histories feed the existing settlement path; receipts retain each actual hop origin without persisting traversal references. Old receipts without origin evidence do not invent native chain flights."
